---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import WaitlistForm from '../components/WaitlistForm.astro';
---

<Base>
  <!-- ==================== HEADER ==================== -->
  <header class="site-header">
    <a href="/" class="wordmark" aria-label="Kippi home">Kippi</a>
  </header>

  <main>

    <!-- ==================== §A HERO ==================== -->
    <!--
      Mobile stacking order: headline (1) → pocket (2) → subcopy + form (3)
      Desktop: two-column [copy-col | pocket] side by side
      We achieve mobile order by splitting the copy column into two halves
      (hero-copy-top = headline; hero-copy-bottom = subcopy+form) and using
      CSS flex order to interleave the pocket between them on mobile.
    -->
    <section class="section-hero" aria-label="Hero">
      <div class="hero-inner">

        <!-- HEADLINE — order 1 on mobile, part of left col on desktop -->
        <div class="hero-copy-top">
          <h1 class="hero-headline font-display" data-reveal>
            There's a moment right before it all goes.
          </h1>
        </div>

        <!-- POCKET — order 2 on mobile, right col on desktop -->
        <div class="hero-pocket" aria-label="Kippi resting in her warm burrow">
          <!-- Warm amber radial glow — bleeds warmth into the cream page -->
          <div class="pocket-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <!-- Candle-flicker: very subtle opacity variation on the glow -->
          <div class="pocket-flicker" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <!-- Scene: edges dissolved via radial mask. No hard card border. -->
          <div class="pocket-scene">
            <div class="pocket-breathe">
              <img
                src="/mascot/kippi-recline.png"
                alt="Kippi resting in her warm candlelit burrow"
                width="560"
                height="560"
                loading="eager"
                fetchpriority="high"
                class="pocket-img"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- SUBCOPY + FORM — order 3 on mobile, bottom of left col on desktop -->
        <div class="hero-copy-bottom">
          <p class="hero-subcopy" data-reveal>
            You ate one thing you weren't planning to. Or the day just wore you down.
            And now there's a pull you know too well — the logic that says today doesn't
            count anymore, so you might as well.
          </p>

          <p class="hero-subcopy" data-reveal>
            Kippi is a friend that shows up in that window. Before the loop closes.
            Or after, without any judgment about how it went.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-form-wrap" data-reveal>
            <WaitlistForm id="hero-form" />
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== §B THE LOOP ==================== -->
    <!-- Warm cream with bg-surface. No mascot. Copy breathes with white space. -->
    <section class="section-b" aria-label="The loop">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2 class="section-headline font-display" data-reveal>
          One thing off plan, and then the switch flips.
        </h2>
        <div class="body-text" data-reveal>
          <p>
            You know the feeling. It doesn't matter how the first thing happened — a dinner
            with friends, a moment of stress, a day where you were holding it together and
            then you weren't. One bite, and something in your head says: well, today's
            already gone.
          </p>
          <p>
            That's when the logic takes over. Not your logic. The other one. The one that
            says it's already over, so why stop now.
          </p>
          <p>
            Every app out there is waiting for you on the other side of this. It wants you
            to log what happened. Reflect on your triggers. Fill in a form. By the time
            you're doing that, you're already past the moment that actually mattered.
          </p>
          <p class="landing-line-light">
            What nobody has built is something for the window before. The twenty minutes
            when the loop is just starting to close.
          </p>
          <p class="landing-line-light">That's what Kippi is.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== §C WHAT KIPPI DOES ==================== -->
    <!-- Cream bg-elevated band. Split: copy | phone/chat visual. -->
    <section class="section-c" aria-label="What Kippi does">
      <div class="section-inner section-inner--split">

        <div class="split-copy" data-reveal>
          <h2 class="section-headline font-display">
            Kippi says the first thing.
          </h2>
          <div class="body-text">
            <p>You don't have to know what to say. You don't have to explain yourself. You don't have to start.</p>
            <p>
              You open the app and Kippi is already there — a small message waiting. From
              there, you just talk. Kippi stays with you while the feeling rises and falls.
              It doesn't try to fix anything. It doesn't push you toward anything.
            </p>
            <p class="landing-line-light">It just doesn't leave.</p>
            <p>
              And if you open the app after a hard night — not before, but after — that
              door is just as open. Whatever the moment is, Kippi meets you there.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="split-visual" data-reveal aria-label="Chat preview">
          <!-- Phone frame: restyled for light palette -->
          <div class="phone-frame" role="img" aria-label="Kippi chat interface showing a warm conversation">
            <div class="phone-screen">
              <div class="chat-header">
                <div class="chat-avatar-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                    <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="10" fill="#C27348" opacity="0.15"/>
                    <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="5" fill="#C27348" opacity="0.35"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="chat-name">Kippi</span>
                <span class="chat-status">here with you</span>
              </div>
              <div class="chat-messages">
                <div class="msg msg-kippi">
                  Hey. I'm here with you right now. What's going on?
                </div>
                <div class="msg msg-user">
                  I don't know. The urge came out of nowhere.
                </div>
                <div class="msg msg-kippi">
                  That makes sense. You don't have to explain it.<br />
                  Can we just stay here for a bit?
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== BRIDGE: cream to dark ==================== -->
    <div class="bridge bridge--to-dark" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- ==================== §D RELAPSE IS RECOVERY ==================== -->
    <!-- THE one dark band. Warm Dark #1C1410. Moss accent. Small immersed Kippi optional. -->
    <section class="section-d section-dark" aria-label="Relapse is recovery">
      <!-- Moss glow: the recovery thread -->
      <div class="relapse-moss-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <!-- Urge-wave line: decorative, aria-hidden -->
      <svg class="urge-wave" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 1200 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <path d="M0 50 C200 50, 300 14, 600 14 C900 14, 1000 50, 1200 50" stroke="rgba(122,158,110,0.16)" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/>
      </svg>

      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2 class="section-headline section-headline--xl font-display" data-reveal>
          Relapse is recovery.
        </h2>
        <div class="body-text body-text--dark" data-reveal>
          <p>Every app we found has a streak.</p>
          <p>
            And every streak is a number that resets when you slip. Which means the app —
            the thing you opened to help you — becomes the thing that tells you how badly
            you've done.
          </p>
          <p>
            That isn't how this works. With binge eating, slipping back is a normal part
            of the arc. Clinically expected. Not a derailment. Not a verdict on who you
            are or whether you're going to be okay.
          </p>
          <p>So there is no streak in Kippi. There's nothing to reset.</p>
          <p>
            If you open the app and the first thing you want to say is "I just binged" —
            that's a first-class door, right on the home screen.
            Kippi meets you there the same way it meets you anywhere.
          </p>
          <p class="relapse-close">Without judgment. Without making it a big thing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== BRIDGE: dark to cream ==================== -->
    <div class="bridge bridge--to-cream" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- ==================== §E GROUNDED IN SOMETHING REAL ==================== -->
    <!-- Clean cream. No mascot. Minimal. Less glow. Documentary feel. -->
    <section class="section-e" aria-label="Grounded in something real">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2 class="section-headline font-display" data-reveal>
          Not meditation and vibes.
        </h2>
        <div class="body-text" data-reveal>
          <p>
            The ideas Kippi draws on are the same ones used in evidence-based approaches
            to binge eating urges. Including urge surfing — the practice of riding out a
            craving rather than fighting it or giving in to it.
          </p>
          <p>
            The core idea is simple: an urge is a wave. It rises, it peaks, it falls —
            usually within twenty to thirty minutes. You don't have to defeat it. You just
            have to get to the other side.
          </p>
          <p>Kippi is built around that window.</p>
          <p class="landing-line-light">
            It isn't therapy. It won't pretend to be. It's a friend for the moment — and
            it's honest about that.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== §F CLOSING WAITLIST ==================== -->
    <!-- Cream / soft warm. Echo of the hero warmth. -->
    <section class="section-f" aria-label="Join the waitlist">
      <div class="closing-ambient" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2 class="section-headline section-headline--lg font-display" data-reveal>
          Kippi will be here.
        </h2>
        <p class="closing-subcopy" data-reveal>
          Be the first to know when it's ready.
        </p>
        <div class="closing-form-wrap" data-reveal>
          <WaitlistForm id="closing-form" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <!-- ==================== §G FOOTER ==================== -->
  <!-- Deeper warm footer — bg-elevated on cream. -->
  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <span class="wordmark wordmark--footer">Kippi</span>
        <p class="footer-tagline">Relapse is recovery.</p>
      </div>

      <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="Footer navigation">
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
        <a href="mailto:hello@kippi.help">hello@kippi.help</a>
      </nav>

      <!-- SAGE-LOCKED: verbatim from Sage-approved wording. Do not alter. -->
      <p class="footer-crisis">
        If you're in crisis, struggling to stay safe, or thinking about harming yourself,
        please reach out now. In the US, call or text
        <a href="tel:988" class="crisis-link">988</a> (Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline),
        or call ANAD's eating-disorders helpline at
        <a href="tel:8883757767" class="crisis-link">888-375-7767</a>.
        Outside the US, please contact your local emergency services.
        Kippi is a companion — not an emergency service, and not a substitute for professional help.
      </p>

      <p class="footer-copy">&copy; 2026 Kippi</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Base>

<style>
  /* ==================== SITE HEADER ==================== */
  .site-header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    padding: var(--space-5) var(--side-margin);
    background-color: rgba(250, 247, 242, 0.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .wordmark {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-variation-settings: 'WONK' 0.6, 'opsz' 18;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .wordmark:hover { color: var(--text-primary); }

  /* ==================== §A HERO ==================== */
  .section-hero {
    background-color: var(--bg-primary);
    padding: var(--space-16) var(--side-margin) var(--space-20);
  }

  /*
    Mobile: flex column with explicit order
      hero-copy-top  (headline)   order: 1
      hero-pocket                 order: 2
      hero-copy-bottom (subcopy)  order: 3
    Desktop (>= 720px): CSS grid 2-column
      Left col spans copy-top + copy-bottom (stacked)
      Right col = pocket
  */
  .hero-inner {
    max-width: var(--wide-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-10);
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .hero-copy-top {
    order: 1;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .hero-pocket {
    order: 2;
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 380px;
    align-self: center;
  }

  .hero-copy-bottom {
    order: 3;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .hero-headline {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 7vw, 52px);
    line-height: 1.14;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .hero-subcopy {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.68;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .hero-form-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }

  /* ---- Kippi pocket: the immersive scene ---- */
  .pocket-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 140%;
    height: 140%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    background: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 70% 65% at 50% 50%,
      rgba(196, 154, 60, 0.22) 0%,
      rgba(194, 115, 72, 0.12) 38%,
      rgba(250, 247, 242, 0) 70%
    );
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    animation: glow-breathe 5s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }

  /* Candle-flicker: very subtle opacity variation on the glow */
  .pocket-flicker {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 120%;
    height: 120%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    background: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 55% 50% at 50% 52%,
      rgba(216, 150, 90, 0.14) 0%,
      transparent 65%
    );
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    animation: candle-flicker 3.8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .pocket-scene {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    /* Overflow hidden: clips the scale-up so it doesn't push layout */
    overflow: hidden;
    width: 100%;
    /* Aspect ratio 1:1 */
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    /* Feathered radial mask: opaque core, fast fade. Kills the built-in frame. */
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 62% 60% at 50% 50%,
      #000 35%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7) 52%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2) 68%,
      transparent 82%
    );
    mask-image: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 62% 60% at 50% 50%,
      #000 35%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7) 52%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2) 68%,
      transparent 82%
    );
  }

  .pocket-breathe {
    position: absolute;
    /* Push image outward 12%: the built-in rounded frame/vignette lives at
       the edges — expanding beyond the mask container clips it away entirely */
    inset: -12%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    animation: pocket-breathe 5s var(--ease-calm) infinite alternate;
  }

  .pocket-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  /* Reduced motion: static -- glow + scene present, no movement */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .pocket-glow     { animation: none; opacity: 0.85; }
    .pocket-flicker  { animation: none; opacity: 0.5; }
    .pocket-breathe  { animation: none; }
  }

  /* ==================== §B THE LOOP ==================== */
  .section-b {
    background-color: var(--bg-surface);
    padding: 100px var(--side-margin);
  }

  /* ==================== §C WHAT KIPPI DOES ==================== */
  .section-c {
    background-color: var(--bg-elevated);
    padding: 100px var(--side-margin);
  }

  .section-inner--split {
    max-width: var(--wide-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-12);
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .split-copy {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .split-visual {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
    align-self: center;
  }

  /* Phone frame: light palette version */
  .phone-frame {
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border-default);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    box-shadow:
      0 2px 8px rgba(44, 30, 22, 0.08),
      0 8px 24px rgba(44, 30, 22, 0.06);
  }

  .phone-screen {
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
  }

  .chat-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-4) var(--space-3);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .chat-avatar-wrap {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .chat-name {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    flex: 1;
  }

  .chat-status {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--semantic-success);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .chat-messages {
    padding: var(--space-4);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .msg {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    max-width: 88%;
  }

  .msg-kippi {
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border-radius: 14px 14px 14px 4px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .msg-user {
    background: var(--accent-primary-subtle);
    border: 1px solid rgba(194, 115, 72, 0.25);
    border-radius: 14px 14px 4px 14px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    align-self: flex-end;
  }

  /* ==================== BRIDGE BANDS ==================== */
  .bridge {
    display: block;
    height: 80px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .bridge--to-dark {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-primary) 0%, #1C1410 100%);
  }

  /* After section-e (cream) back to footer cream -- no bridge needed, footer has its own bg */
  /* The bridge from dark back to cream is below §D */
  .bridge--to-cream {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1C1410 0%, var(--bg-primary) 100%);
  }

  /* ==================== §D RELAPSE IS RECOVERY ==================== */
  .section-d {
    position: relative;
    padding: 100px var(--side-margin);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .relapse-moss-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 700px;
    height: 700px;
    background: radial-gradient(
      ellipse at center,
      rgba(122, 158, 110, 0.13) 0%,
      rgba(122, 158, 110, 0.04) 42%,
      transparent 66%
    );
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .urge-wave {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 32px;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 60px;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .section-d .section-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* §D uses Warm Dark text tokens -- enforced via .section-dark class */
  .body-text--dark p {
    color: #C4A98A; /* text-secondary warm dark */
  }

  .relapse-close {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-variation-settings: 'WONK' 0.6, 'opsz' 20;
    font-size: 20px !important;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #7A9E6E !important; /* moss -- same hex both modes */
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }

  /* ==================== §E GROUNDED ==================== */
  .section-e {
    background-color: var(--bg-primary);
    padding: 100px var(--side-margin);
  }

  /* §E: less ambient glow than hero -- no decorative background elements, just text */

  /* ==================== §F CLOSING WAITLIST ==================== */
  .section-f {
    background-color: var(--bg-surface);
    padding: 100px var(--side-margin) var(--space-20);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Soft ambient warmth behind the closing section -- much quieter than the hero */
  .closing-ambient {
    position: absolute;
    top: -80px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 600px;
    height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(
      ellipse at center,
      rgba(194, 115, 72, 0.06) 0%,
      transparent 65%
    );
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .section-f .section-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .section-f .section-headline {
    max-width: 500px;
  }

  .closing-subcopy {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .closing-form-wrap {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
  }

  /* ==================== §G FOOTER ==================== */
  .site-footer {
    background-color: var(--bg-elevated);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding: var(--space-12) var(--side-margin) var(--space-10);
  }

  .footer-inner {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .footer-brand {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .wordmark--footer {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .footer-tagline {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-variation-settings: 'WONK' 0.6, 'opsz' 14;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .footer-links a {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--text-secondary); }

  .footer-crisis {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    max-width: 560px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding-top: var(--space-5);
  }

  .crisis-link {
    color: var(--semantic-crisis);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .crisis-link:hover { color: var(--semantic-crisis); }

  .footer-copy {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  /* ==================== SHARED SECTION UTILITIES ==================== */
  .section-inner {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-headline {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 38px);
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .section-headline--xl {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 5.5vw, 48px);
  }

  .section-headline--lg {
    font-size: clamp(26px, 4.5vw, 42px);
  }

  .body-text {
    display: flex;
